
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Donation Request Verified - Daan</title>
</head>

<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f7f5; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #333333;">

  <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);">

    <!-- Header -->
    <div style="background-color: #166534; padding: 25px; text-align: center;">
      <h1 style="margin: 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 28px;">
         Daan
      </h1>

      <p style="margin: 8px 0 0; color: #dcfce7; font-size: 14px;">
        Donate With Trust
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div style="padding: 35px 30px;">

      <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 25px;">
        <div style="font-size: 50px;">✅</div>

        <h2 style="margin: 10px 0; color: #166534;">
          Donation Request Verified
        </h2>

        <p style="margin: 0; color: #666666; font-size: 15px;">
          Your request has been successfully verified by the Daan administration team.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
        Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,
      </p>

      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555555;">
        We are happy to inform you that your donation request has been
        reviewed and <strong>verified</strong> by the Daan administration team.
      </p>

      <!-- Request Details -->
      <div style="background-color: #f0fdf4; border-left: 4px solid #166534; padding: 18px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 6px;">

        <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 14px; color: #555555;">
          <strong>Request Title:</strong>
          <%= requestTitle %>
        </p>

        <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 14px; color: #555555;">
          <strong>Request ID:</strong>
          <%= requestId %>
        </p>

        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #555555;">
          <strong>Status:</strong>
          <span style="color: #166534; font-weight: bold;">
            VERIFIED
          </span>
        </p>

      </div>

      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555555;">
        Your request is now visible to eligible donors on the Daan platform.
        Donors can review the information you provided and decide whether
        they would like to support your situation.
      </p>

      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555555;">
        You may receive messages or donation support from donors through the
        Daan platform.
      </p>

      <!-- Important Note -->
      <div style="background-color: #fffbeb; padding: 18px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0;">

        <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: #92400e; font-size: 16px;">
          Important
        </h3>

        <p style="margin: 0; color: #666666; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
          Please make sure that the information provided in your request
          remains accurate and up to date. If your situation changes,
          update your request accordingly.
        </p>

      </div>

      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555555;">
        Thank you for trusting <strong>Daan</strong>.
        We hope this platform helps connect you with people who are willing
        to make a difference.
      </p>

      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">
        Best regards,<br />
        <strong>Daan Team</strong>
      </p>

    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <div style="background-color: #f0fdf4; padding: 20px; text-align: center;">

      <p style="margin: 0; color: #166534; font-size: 13px;">
        Daan - Donate With Trust
      </p>

      <p style="margin: 8px 0 0; color: #777777; font-size: 12px;">
        This is an automated email. Please do not reply directly to this email.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>

</body>
</html>

